This product adapts *patterns* (never copied source) from the following
projects, with gratitude and attribution:

- Unsloth (https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth, Apache-2.0):
  monkeypatch-at-load acceleration, offloaded gradient checkpointing shape,
  chunked cross-entropy shape, VRAM-aware auto batch sizing. Used strictly
  as an installed dependency; unsloth-zoo (LGPL-3.0) is depended on,
  never vendored; the AGPL-3.0 MoE grouped-GEMM subtree is not used at all.
- Hugging Face kernels / kernel-builder (https://github.com/huggingface/kernels,
  Apache-2.0): kernel repo layout and provenance-metadata conventions.
- GitHub Actions self-hosted runner docs: service-survives-reboot and
  idempotent-job-id lessons (mechanism itself not used — no runner here).
- sigstore/model-transparency (Apache-2.0): prior art studied for artifact
  signing; SZL's receipt chain is an independent implementation.

DSSE/in-toto envelope format per https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse.
